                <p> <style>body {font-family: 'arial'}</style><p>This is th=
e latest update regarding outage restoration efforts on the North Shore.</p=
>
<p>KIUC and HECO line crews continued repairing damaged lines, poles and el=
ectrical equipment on the North Shore today.</p>
<p>Based on progress to date, KIUC anticipates that the first North Shore r=
estorations could occur in portions of Princeville and Hanalei Wednesday, a=
lthough any number of factors =E2=80=93 including weather =E2=80=93 could i=
mpact this estimate. Once those first restorations are made, we can better =
estimate a restoration timeline for the rest of the North Shore.</p>
<p>Note that these restoration estimates are based on current conditions an=
d may change if crews encounter additional damage or other unforeseen chall=
enges.</p>
<p>Mahalo for your patience.</p></p>
